•HospiTex – Healthcare Management Web Application  Overview:
HospiTex is a full-stack healthcare management platform designed
to unify access for Patients, Doctors, and Diagnostic Centers. It
provides personalized dashboards, role-based navigation, and a
seamless login/signup experience.  Key Features:  Role-Based
Dashboards: Dynamic content and navigation based on user type
(Patient, Doctor, Diagnostic).  Authentication: Sign Up/Login with
user type selection. Users are redirected to appropriate
dashboards.  Patient Portal: Appointment booking, diagnostic
services, ambulance requests, and profile management.  Doctor
Portal: Manage patient consultations, view medical history, and
track appointments.  Diagnostic Portal: Upload lab reports, manage
tests, and communicate with patients.  Responsive UI: Interactive
navbars, hoverable profile avatars with logout/profile options. 
Landing Page: Multi-portal welcome page with hero section, feature
highlights, and contact info.  Context Management: React Context
API manages users, authentication state, and role-based access. 
Future Ready: Designed for integration with databases (MongoDB,
Firebase) and notifications.  Technical Stack:  Frontend: React.js,
React Router, Tailwind CSS  State Management: React Context
API  UI/UX: Responsive design, gradient-based dashboards,
interactive profile avatars  Notifications: Toastify for feedback on
login/signup actions  Achievements:  Implemented a multi-role
authentication system with real-time redirection based on role. 
Designed role-specific dashboards to optimize workflow for
Patients, Doctors, and Diagnostics.  Built a scalable architecture
ready for backend integration.
